{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1539972-reality-stalker-2e-conversion","id":1539972,"title":"Reality Stalker 2e Conversion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-08-06T21:25:21-07:00","id":1539972,"title":"Reality Stalker 2e Conversion","content":"<br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Reality Stalkers</b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Sneaks</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Pages 173-176 of The Mysterium and 77 of Nameless and Accursed for Lore</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Parent Path: </b>Mastigos<br /> <b>Parent Order: </b>The Mysterium<br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Space 2, Mind 1, Larceny 2, one of the following additional skills at 2 dots or higher: Athletics, Streetwise Subterfuge, Survival<br /> <b>Initiation:</b> Travel through a fracture after having accepted the philosophy and teachings of the legacy.<br /> <b>Ruling Arcana: </b>Space<br /> <b>Yantras: </b>Cracked glass (+1); A key (+1); Casting while unseen (+2)<br /> <b>Oblations:</b> Discovering a secret; Breaking into a building without magic; Traveling long distance without using magic<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Attainments</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>First Attainment: Noticing the Cracks</b></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Prerequisites: Initiation</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">The first skill a sneak must learn is to notice the fractures in the fallen world and understand them. This attainment has two functions, the first allows for the mage\u2019s peripheral mage sight to notice all irises, even those that are closed, as if they are an active magical effect, and allows the mages active Space sight to see all irises, including closed ones. The second power gained from this attainment allows the sneak to learn the key of any iris within arms reach after studying it for one turn.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Second Attainment: Slipping Through the Cracks</b></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Prerequisites: Space 2, 3 dots in Larceny</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">The sneak learns quickly how to get out of traps and prisons, slipping out, or in, as if stepping through the fractures. This attainment functions like the spell \u201cBreak Boundary\u201d (Space 2, MtAw 174) with reach assigned to instant casting.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Optional: Mind 2</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">The sneaks have learned the need to protect themselves from being discovered and have developed this attainment to mask their thoughts from those who may be able to pry to learn their intentions. The attainment functions as \u201cAlter Mental Pattern\u201d (Mind 2, MtAw 160) with reach for advanced duration. The sneak must spend one hour in meditation to activate this attainment.</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Third Attainment: Gazing Through the Cracks</b></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Prerequisites: Space 3, The optional skill used to meet the requirements of initiation must be raised to 3 or a second option from the list must be raised to 2</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Traveling through the fractures of the fallen world can be a dangerous task, and not knowing what you\u2019ll find on the other side of one can result in injury or death, therefore, the sneak learns to see the other side of a fracture so they can determine the safety of crossing through it, or any other preparations that might need to be made. This attainment functions as \u201cScrying\u201d (Space 2, MtAw 174) with reach assigned for instant casting and sensory range. If used on an iris, the sneak can see to the other side of it.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Optional: Mind 3</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">The sneak knows that attention is something to be avoided, so they learn quickly the practice to have the eyes of others slide off of them. This attainment functions like \u201cIncognito Presence\u201d (Mind 2, MtAw 160) with reach for advanced duration and instant casting. It takes one mana to activate this attainment. </span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Fourth Attainment: Using the Cracks</b></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Prerequisites: Space 4, 4 dots in Larceny</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">By this time, the sneak understands how to create small fractures in the lie on their person. Any pocket or container they carry can be widened by manipulating the space within it. This attainment functions as the spell \u201cOptimal Container\u201d (Space 3, SoS 66) with reach for advanced duration and instant casting.</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Optional: Mind 4</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">The truth of the matter is, sometimes sneaks get caught, sometimes someone sees through their magic, or discovers what they are planning, or any other number of things that could put the sneak in danger, this attainment was developed for these moments. By touching an individual the sneak can hide the memories away as if they had cast the \u201cMemory Hole\u201d (Mind 2, MtAw 160) spell, with reach for instant casting, sensory range, and advanced duration. Eventually the person will remember, but by then the sneak will be long gone.</span><br /> \u200b<br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Fifth Attainment: Crack the Fallen World</b></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Prerequisites: Space 5, The optional skill used to meet the requirements of initiation must be raised to 4 or a second option from the list must be raised to 3 or a third option must be raised to 2</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">The master sneaks, those who have truly internalized the teachings of the legacy, can shatter the space in the fallen world long enough to move great distances, making them nearly impossible to trap, or to keep them from intruding. This attainment functions as \u201cCo-Location\u201d (Space 3, MtAw 176) with reach for instant casting, reach for sympathetic range, and reach to create a portal for the duration of the attainment, which appears as a fracture in the fallen world. This attainment takes one mana to activate.</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Optional: Mind 5</span><br /> The final attainment a sneak learns allows for them to turn any item into something that is coveted by others, either to be used as a bargaining tool or a distraction. The attainment functions like the spell \u201cGive Me That\u201d (Mind 3, SoS 66) with reach to make the attainment activate instantly, with advanced duration, and to change the primary faction to potency. The attainment is withstood by composure.<br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26284,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","user":"Aendrinastor","date":". 08-08-2024, 12:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-06T21:29:14-07:00","id":1539973,"title":"","content":"Hello all. Reality Stalkers, started working on this a long time ago and finally sat down tonight to finish it up and got stuck. You'll notice that the fourth attainment is completely empty, and I didn't really know what I wanted to do for the optional 5th attainment either.<br /> <br /> The philosophy was that the Space attainments interact with the cracks in the fallen world, while the Mind attainments function as a sort of smokescreen, helping the sneak avoid detection as they run around the fallen world, likely ending up in places a lot where they aren't welcome.<br /> <br /> For the fourth attainment, Originally I was going to give them the Break Boundaries spell, but that fely like a placeholder until they got the fifth one, so I wasn't impressed.<br /> For the fourth optional attainment, I'm playing with either the idea of Imposter, making it so that other people see them as someone else, or Universal Language, which does break my Mind theme of ofuscation and such, but with them running through portals and such, being able to speak with anyone wherever they might end up <i>would</i> be a useful skill.<br /> <br /> So, ideas?<br /> <br /> This is a legacy that one of my PCs is planning to join, eventually.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-06T21:53:22-07:00","id":1539974,"title":"","content":"I think you could move the order a bit to fix the issue, since <i>Scrying</i> would require you to touch the potentially dangerous thing to create the window. In addition, Space Sight already detects all Irises (core book page 91) and a Knowing spell can uncover the Key.<br /> <br /> So how about moving <i>Scrying</i> up to get instant use and sensory range. Next place <i>Break Boundary</i> at Space 2. <i>Optimal Container</i> can now be placed in Space 4, gaining instant use and advanced duration, making anything into a potential stash or hiding place.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-06T22:27:47-07:00","id":1539976,"title":"","content":"Active mage sight detects irises, I wanted to give the legacy the ability to passively know when one is nearby, similar to how Death sight lets you see a ghost, but with Death 2 your passive sight now picks them up, and then the second half of that attainment is meant to reproduce the knowing effect from a Space 1 spell.<br /> <br /> Scrying could be moved to the third, that does make sense to let them look through it from a distance, and then break boundary as the second attainment with instant casting lets them get out of problems but keeps them from being able to just slip through any obstacle so then that final attainment still feels good while also not stepping on Break Boundary. All this makes sense, I'll move those attainments around tomorrow, need sleep tonight. Appriciate you!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-07T01:56:30-07:00","id":1539981,"title":"","content":"boom, made the update and figured out the fourth optional attainment, so just the final optional to go","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-07T06:16:57-07:00","id":1539986,"title":"","content":"I wonder if <i>Incognito Presence</i> and <i>Memory Hole</i> should be moved one spot up. <i>Incognito Presence</i> with instant use and advanced duration is a great panic button. If someone catches the mage, they could either try to run away or capture them, so adding sensory range to <i>Memory Hole</i> might be useful.<br /> <br /> The final optional Attainment could be <i>Give Me That</i>, with Reach assigned to instant use, changing primary factor and advanced duration. This gives the mage something the target wants as a bargaining tool. Not only that, thanks to conjunctional Space, it gains an automatic Strong sympathetic connection for future use.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-07T09:19:42-07:00","id":1539991,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1539972-reality-stalker-2e-conversion?p=1539986#post1539986\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if <i>Incognito Presence</i> and <i>Memory Hole</i> should be moved one spot up. <i>Incognito Presence</i> with instant use and advanced duration is a great panic button. If someone catches the mage, they could either try to run away or capture them, so adding sensory range to <i>Memory Hole</i> might be useful.<br /> <br /> The final optional Attainment could be <i>Give Me That</i>, with Reach assigned to instant use, changing primary factor and advanced duration. This gives the mage something the target wants as a bargaining tool. Not only that, thanks to conjunctional Space, it gains an automatic Strong sympathetic connection for future use.</div> </div> </div> </div>Moving those two up does make some sense, and then gives space (lol) for mental shield so the mages thoughts are safe, which is something I had been considering (shielding attainments go so hard).<br /> <br /> Is Give Me That in SoS?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-07T09:23:55-07:00","id":1539992,"title":"","content":"Just found it, really good idea, I'l let it sit while I'm at work today and see how it feels","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-07T09:46:51-07:00","id":1539994,"title":"","content":"Maybe <i>Alter Mental Pattern c</i>ould provide more utility than <i>Mental Shield</i>. Since its a Veiling, it does not ping the Peripheral Sight and raise suspicion. It also helps them lie their way out of situations, which follows Mind's thematic roll of damage control. Since only mages guaranteeably know when they enter a Clash of Wills, it means that if a vampire's Auspex fails, for example, then your surface thoughts will seem to match your words and they will be none the wiser.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 08-07-2024, 01:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-07T19:18:43-07:00","id":1540028,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1539972-reality-stalker-2e-conversion?p=1539994#post1539994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe <i>Alter Mental Pattern c</i>ould provide more utility than <i>Mental Shield</i>. Since its a Veiling, it does not ping the Peripheral Sight and raise suspicion. It also helps them lie their way out of situations, which follows Mind's thematic roll of damage control. Since only mages guaranteeably know when they enter a Clash of Wills, it means that if a vampire's Auspex fails, for example, then your surface thoughts will seem to match your words and they will be none the wiser.</div> </div> </div> </div>you're really good at this","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}